all right let's get into audience  questions for the week first one is  david based on the numbers we're seeing  about loyalty to donald trump and people  willing to leave the republican party if  he starts a new party  is it fair to say that donald trump's  voters are more loyal to him  than obama and biden's voters are loyal  to them  i think that there's a complexity to  this question because  what we mean by loyalty may not be the  same thing  if what we mean by loyalty we mean  lack of willingness to criticize them in  other words  you're loyal in that you'll never  criticize anything they do  i think that yes donald trump's  followers  are more loyal to him you see many on  the left  who vote for it voted for biden voted  for obama  voted for obama for reelection and yet  had many criticisms  of them and some might say that that  means they're less loyal  i don't know i'm not so sure about that  i i think that  one of the things that does that is  unique to the trump voter  is that because many of them either were  sort of like disaffected republicans who  already had  some disdain for the republican party or  were brought into politics by trump  and if trump had been a democrat they  would have become democrats  trump ran as a republican so they're you  know putatively ostensibly republicans  they don't really care about the  republican party  and when you think about all of these  folks who  joined politics essentially to follow  donald trump they liked the dog  whistling  on the xenophobic sort of racist stuff  they don't really care about abortion  like you know trump made up this thing  about how he used to be pro-choice now  he's pro-life because he met a kid he  liked or something like that  uh at 68 and then he became pro-life and  so that  appealed to some of the evangelicals  most historical republicans went with  trump because they weren't going to go  for hillary but  the people that trump brought in they  don't really care about most of the  stuff that a lot of republicans care  about they'll go with it if trump wants  it but  they're not really about the debt  they're not really about abortion  they're not really about religious  liberty  they liked the sort of vibe of trump and  the dog whistling  that came with it trump came in and he  said you know george w bush was wrong on  the war and  mitt romney sucks and i you know john  mccain i prefer  war heroes who don't get captured and  obama might not even be american and  the mexican rapist and all this  different stuff and that was really what  they were  motivated by and so it's less to me  that they are super loyal to trump it's  that they don't really care about  anything else that's going on in the  political world they never really cared  about anything  other than trump's words even trump's  actions they don't really care about  remember  about seven eight months into trump's  presidency i got a call from some guy in  california i think it was  who said you know trump's just the best  everything he's done his best  and i said well what has he actually  done so far and he didn't actually list  anything  and i said well what motivated you to  vote for trump what promises did you  like and he said building the wall  i said okay so if there's no wall across  the entire border in november of 2020  you're not voting for trump and he said  no i'm probably still voting for trump  they don't really care about issues they  they care about trump  because of the things he says and how he  says them and in that way  it's a debate whether you call it  loyalty  or simply they don't care enough about  anything else  to consider abandoning donald trump i  think it's the latter  you tell me whether the term loyalty  does or doesn't apply  i'm really excited that one of our  sponsors today is  helix sleep i sleep on a helix mattress  at home  i absolutely love it and that's why i  reached out to them about sponsoring the  david pakman show  buying a mattress in the past was always  a huge guessing game for me  i didn't know what i actually needed i  didn't know what i would like but helix  has a sleep quiz on their website  you tell them your body type your  sleeping position your back pain issues  you might have  and their tool matched me with a  mattress  that is perfect for me it's cool enough  at night  it's the right firmness i generally just  do  way better sleeping these days because  of the mattress  helix was awarded number one best  overall mattress for the last two years  by both gq and wired magazine it is well  deserved i can tell you firsthand  every helix mattress comes with a 10  year warranty  you can try the mattress risk free for  100 nights  and they will even come pick it up at  your house if you don't love it  but i know you will all of my viewers  will get up to  200 off your order and you'll get two  super premium pillows for free  when you go to the link right underneath  this video

